      "writtenOn": "2015-10-27T03:24:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Transmitter power plane is from system \"S3\" power, which is enabled by PM_SLP_S4 and PM_SLP_S5. Transmitter SRAM power would drop if system power off to \"S5\" state, it makes FW and EDID data loss. So EC need to flash FW and EDID on CHIPSET_STARTUP.",
